          <h3>Turn a won deal into an invoice without retyping a thing</h3>
          <p class="ld-sub">The deal already has the customer, the line items, and the amount. Gushwork builds the invoice straight from it and sends it to your customer.</p>
          <ul class="ld-ticks">
            <li><svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 256 256" fill="currentColor"><path d="M176.49,95.51a12,12,0,0,1,0,17l-56,56a12,12,0,0,1-17,0l-24-24a12,12,0,1,1,17-17L112,143l47.51-47.52A12,12,0,0,1,176.49,95.51ZM236,128A108,108,0,1,1,128,20,108.12,108.12,0,0,1,236,128Zm-24,0a84,84,0,1,0-84,84A84.09,84.09,0,0,0,212,128Z"/></svg>Invoices created from the deal record</li>
            <li><svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 256 256" fill="currentColor"><path d="M176.49,95.51a12,12,0,0,1,0,17l-56,56a12,12,0,0,1-17,0l-24-24a12,12,0,1,1,17-17L112,143l47.51-47.52A12,12,0,0,1,176.49,95.51ZM236,128A108,108,0,1,1,128,20,108.12,108.12,0,0,1,236,128Zm-24,0a84,84,0,1,0-84,84A84.09,84.09,0,0,0,212,128Z"/></svg>Line items carried over from the quote</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
