          <h3>Overdue invoices get chased until they&rsquo;re paid</h3>
          <p class="ld-sub">The collections agent sends polite reminders on the schedule you set, so cash comes in without anyone on your team making awkward calls.</p>
          <ul class="ld-ticks">
            <li><svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 256 256" fill="currentColor"><path d="M176.49,95.51a12,12,0,0,1,0,17l-56,56a12,12,0,0,1-17,0l-24-24a12,12,0,1,1,17-17L112,143l47.51-47.52A12,12,0,0,1,176.49,95.51ZM236,128A108,108,0,1,1,128,20,108.12,108.12,0,0,1,236,128Zm-24,0a84,84,0,1,0-84,84A84.09,84.09,0,0,0,212,128Z"/></svg>Reminders go out the day an invoice is late</li>
            <li><svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 256 256" fill="currentColor"><path d="M176.49,95.51a12,12,0,0,1,0,17l-56,56a12,12,0,0,1-17,0l-24-24a12,12,0,1,1,17-17L112,143l47.51-47.52A12,12,0,0,1,176.49,95.51ZM236,128A108,108,0,1,1,128,20,108.12,108.12,0,0,1,236,128Zm-24,0a84,84,0,1,0-84,84A84.09,84.09,0,0,0,212,128Z"/></svg>Paid invoices update the deal automatically</li>
